'''Brigade Enterprises Limited''' is an Indian real estate and [[property development]] company that is based in [[Bangalore]].<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.reuters.com/finance/stocks/company-officers/BRIGol.NS|title=Brigade Enterprises Ltd Description|website=U.S.|access-date=2018-10-24}}</ref> The Brigade Group also has operations in [[Mangalore]],<ref>{{Cite web|url=http://www.daijiworld.com/news/newsDisplay.aspx?newsID=431134|title=Mangaluru: 'Brigade' luxury apartment project inaugurated at Derebail|access-date=2018-07-23}}</ref> [[Mysore]], [[Chennai]], [[Kochi]], [[Hyderabad]], [[Chikmagalur]], [[Ahmedabad]]<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://cdn.brigadegroup.com/assets/docs/investor/annual-reports/bel-annual-report-2020-21-12082021.pdf|title=Annual Report 2020-2021|access-date=2021-08-27}}</ref> and a representative office in [[Dubai]].<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.ndtv.com/business/stock/brigade-enterprises-ltd_brigade/reports|title=Brigade Enterprises: Reports, Company History, Directors Report, Chairman's Speech, Auditors Report of Brigade Enterprises|website=NDTV|access-date=2018-10-24|archive-url=https://archive.today/20251201101346/https://web.archive.org/web/20190825095355/https://www.ndtv.com/business/stock/brigade-enterprises-ltd_brigade/reports|archive-date=1 December 2025}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.indiatoday.in/pti-feed/story/brigade-2-last-643170-2016-07-19|title=About Brigade Group|website=India Today|date=2016-07-19|access-date=2018-10-24}}</ref> It has won national and international awards in the construction industry.<ref>{{cite news|url=http://www.thehindu.com/todays-paper/tp-features/tp-propertyplus/brigade-group-bags-award-for-best-commercial-project/article1093701.ece|title=Brigade Group bags award for best commercial project|work=[[The Hindu]]}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|title=Brigade Group wins four awards|url=http://www.moneycontrol.com/news/announcements/brigade-group-wins-four-awards_876550.html|publisher=money Control}}</ref> It was founded by M.R. Jaishankar in the year 1986.<ref>{{Cite web|url=http://www.mydigitalfc.com/deep-dive/top-builders-bangalore|title=Top builders of Bangalore|website=www.mydigitalfc.com|date=2018-05-28|access-date=2018-07-23}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|title=India Top Builder - Brigade Group|url=http://www.constructionworld.in/News.aspx?nId=jmZJVa28cK8VvDPk8a2N6A==|archive-url=https://archive.today/20140221170755/http://www.constructionworld.in/News.aspx?nId=jmZJVa28cK8VvDPk8a2N6A==|url-status=dead|archive-date=2014-02-21|publisher=Construction World}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|title=Brigade Enterprises Ltd|url=https://wework.co.in/bangalore/|website=World Benchmarking Alliance|access-date=2025-12-01|archive-url=https://archive.today/20251201100601/https://web.archive.org/web/20250323090204/https://www.worldbenchmarkingalliance.org/publication/urban/companies/brigade-enterprises-ltd-2/|archive-date=1 December 2025}}</ref>

Brigade Group provides [[property management]] services, hospitality and education across several major cities in South India.<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.forbes.com/lists/2008/24/biz_bub08_Brigade-Enterprises_VHLH.html|title=Asia's 200 Best Under A Billion: Brigade Enterprises|website=Forbes|access-date=2018-10-24}}</ref><ref>{{Cite news|url=https://www.karnataka.com/real-estate/about-brigade-group-bangalore/|title=About Brigade Group. Bangalore Real Estate Developers|date=2012-11-11|work=Karnataka.com|access-date=2018-10-24}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|url=http://www.constructionweekonline.in/indias-top-real-estate-companies/|title=Top Real Estate Companies in India|website=ConstructionWeekOnline|access-date=2018-07-23}}</ref> The group also owns Brigade Foundation, which is a not-for-profit trust.

==History==
[[File:Orion-mall-BLR-1.jpg|thumb|right|Orion Mall in Bangalore]]
The Brigade Group has Brigade International Finance Centre in [[Gujarat International Finance Tec-City]] and has built [[World Trade Center Bangalore]], [[World Trade Center Chennai]] and [[World Trade Center, Kochi]]. 

Brigade holds the [[World Trade Centers Association|WTCA]] licenses for all the major South Indian cities.<ref>{{cite news|title=World Trade Centre Kochi inaugurated at Infopark|url=https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/city/kochi/World-Trade-Centre-Kochi-inaugurated-at-Infopark/articleshow/55625313.cms|accessdate=2017-12-03|work=[[The Times of India]]|date=2016-11-25}}</ref> 

